    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat-\u2018em-up action on the high seas! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a swashbuckling pirate on a mission to reclaim your stolen ship and treasure map! Fight your way through waves of rival marauders, steal from uppity civilians, and unleash fierce parrots in this fast-paced, belt-scrolling brawler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore stages filled with unique hazards and dynamic environments \u2014such as slippery rooftops, deep underwater, and horse-pulled carriage rides! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 4 unique pirate heroes, each with distinct speeds, attacks, and special moves, including Simon, Coralie, Portia, and the hook-handed Aldemar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 9 stages with varied environments, enemies, and gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable heroes with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasure chests with power-ups and weapons, including pistols and whips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced gameplay - enemies quickly recover from knockdown attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Companion assists and special moves with short cooldown times, allowing for frequent use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swift, satisfying boss battles that don\u2019t overstay their welcome \u2014no damage sponges here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Up to 4-player local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Classic Game Mode: This campaign recreates the original 1989 arcade game and retains its single-player, single-plane gameplay, as well as its graphics and music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ORIGIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buccaneers: Shipshape is an official remake of the 1989 Buccaneers arcade game, created with full support from the original developer, Duintronic S.A. This revamped version introduces exciting new features, including Z-axis movement, additional heroes and villains, brand-new stages, revamped soundtrack and much more!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat-\u2018em-up action on the high seas! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a swashbuckling pirate on a mission to reclaim your stolen ship and treasure map! Fight your way through waves of rival marauders, steal from uppity civilians, and unleash fierce parrots in this fast-paced, belt-scrolling brawler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore stages filled with unique hazards and dynamic environments \u2014such as slippery rooftops, deep underwater, and horse-pulled carriage rides! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 4 unique pirate heroes, each with distinct speeds, attacks, and special moves, including Simon, Coralie, Portia, and the hook-handed Aldemar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 9 stages with varied environments, enemies, and gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable heroes with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasure chests with power-ups and weapons, including pistols and whips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced gameplay - enemies quickly recover from knockdown attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Companion assists and special moves with short cooldown times, allowing for frequent use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swift, satisfying boss battles that don\u2019t overstay their welcome \u2014no damage sponges here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Up to 4-player local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Classic Game Mode: This campaign recreates the original 1989 arcade game and retains its single-player, single-plane gameplay, as well as its graphics and music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ORIGIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buccaneers: Shipshape is an official remake of the 1989 Buccaneers arcade game, created with full support from the original developer, Duintronic S.A. This revamped version introduces exciting new features, including Z-axis movement, additional heroes and villains, brand-new stages, revamped soundtrack and much more!</p>",
    "short_description": "Beat-\u2018em-up action on the high seas! Play as pirate on a mission to reclaim your stolen ship. Fight rival marauders, steal from uppity civilians, and unleash fierce companion parrots in this fast-paced, belt-scrolling brawler packed with humor and mayhem!",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis is an amazing beat \u2018em up game. Merso knows what he\u2019s doing to keep the game not boring. He\u2019s mastered the beat \u2018em up genre.\u201d<br>Mad Little Pixel<br><br>\u201cThe developer knows exactly what makes the genre entertaining: graphical variety, different enemy types with their own tactics, and a fast pace. For me, this is one of the genre highlights of recent years.\u201d<br>DKSN<br><br>\u201cBuccaneers Shipshape is a direct trip back to the golden age of arcades: fast, replayable, humorous, with beautiful visual design, and very polished controls.\u201d<br>Riesgo Aturiax<br>",
